      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah, we checked the reel splitting logs and they look okay. \n\nit's just weird, its always like just a few pieces missing from various batches. it's almost like they just disappear. if it's not a recording error or damaged tape, what else could cause stuff to just... vanish in small amounts?",
