    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "theft seems like a big jump for just a few tiny resistors and capacitors... it's just so random. it's like something is messing with the counts. \n\ncould it be something else? like maybe the sensors or the automation system is glitching or something? just something that would cause things to go missing without being obvious.",
